Sharpie's Gear Judge uses two licenses.

1. STAT WEIGHTS: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

   This covers the stat weight values: the weight tables in Classes/ (ERA, TBC
   and Forever), the leveling curves in Classes/Forever/Curves/ and the gear
   points in Classes/Forever/GearPoints.lua, in every version released from
   3.3.3 on.

   You may share and adapt them, in other addons too, as long as you give
   credit: name "Sharpie's Gear Judge by Supersharpie", link to
   https://sharpiesgearjudge.web.app or the CurseForge page, and say whether
   you changed them.

   Full license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

   Versions released before 3.3.3 keep the MIT License below for all files,
   weights included.

2. EVERYTHING ELSE (the code): MIT License, below.

